error[E0521]: borrowed data escapes outside of closure
  --> tests/ui/application_printer_stash_model.rs:23:9
   |
21 |     let keep: Slot<&Model> = Slot(Cell::new(None));
   |         ---- `keep` declared here, outside of the closure body
22 |     let _ = Application::new().print_model(|model, printer| {
   |                                             ----- `model` is a reference that is only valid in the closure body
23 |         keep.set(model);
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `model` escapes the closure body here
   |
   = note: requirement occurs because of the type `Slot<&Model>`, which makes the generic argument `&Model` invariant
   = note: the struct `Slot<T>` is invariant over the parameter `T`
   = help: see <https://doc.rust-lang.org/nomicon/subtyping.html> for more information about variance
